  "summary": "Ten validated functions grouped into five proposed classes. Three spatial nearest-neighbor queries (0x004038E0 strut scan, 0x004039C0 BVH chain walk, 0x00403AA0 tree walk) share the node-field concepts (position +148/+152/+156, plane coefficients +164/+172, links +268/+272, identifier +300) and a common fallback path into 0x004038E0. Two pure matrix/vector helpers (0x00435E00 3x3xvector multiply, 0x00566E40 Euler-to-matrix) operate on a 3x3 row-major matrix block. Three compressed short-int vector codecs (0x004B2420, 0x004B2580, 0x004B2800) decode packed int16 records with documented scale factors (1/2048, 0.02, 1/512). One per-frame physics transform setup (0x004F17D0) copies a rotation matrix plus input vector and computes the product into a vehicle-physics frame buffer at base+0x34B0. One zero-init helper (0x004F2B10) clears 16-dword embedded array blocks. All owners are UnknownObject in the packet; every class grouping is a DERIVED proposal, not a confirmed source name.",
